elves together to worship God. We do believe that God will save all men.","n":6,"sm":"Ua e fai mai foi, o le a matou fano vagana ai ua matou salamo. E faapefea ona e iloa o mafaufauga ma faamoemoega o o matou loto? E faapefea ona e iloa ua i ai se pogai matou te salamo ai? E faapefea ona e iloa e le o i matou o ni tagata amiotonu? Faauta, ua matou fausia falesa, ma ua matou faapotopoto faatasi i matou lava e tapuai atu i le Atua. Matou te talitonu o le a faaolaina e le Atua tagata uma.","w":[{"en":"·","sm":"Ua"},{"en":"·","sm":"e"},{"en":"·","sm":"fai"},{"en":"·","sm":"mai"},{"en":"Thou also sayest,","sm":"foi,"},{"en":"·","sm":"o"},{"en":"·","sm":"le"},{"en":"·","sm":"a"},{"en":"·","sm":"matou"},{"en":"we shall perish","sm":"fano"},{"en":"·","sm":"vagana"},{"en":"except","sm":"ai"},{"en":"·","sm":"ua"},{"en":"·","sm":"matou"},{"en":"we repent.","sm":"salamo."},{"en":"·","sm":"E"},{"en":"·","sm":"faapefea"},{"en":"·","sm":"ona"},{"en":"·","sm":"e"},{"en":"How knowest thou","sm":"iloa"},{"en":"·","sm":"o"},{"en":"the thoughts","sm":"mafaufauga"},{"en":"·","sm":"ma"},{"en":"and intents","sm":"faamoemoega"},{"en":"·","sm":"o"},{"en":"·","sm":"o"},{"en":"·","sm":"matou"},{"en":"of our hearts?","sm":"loto?"},{"en":"·","sm":"E"},{"en":"·","sm":"faapefea"},{"en":"·","sm":"ona"},{"en":"·","sm":"e"},{"en":"How knowest thou","sm":"iloa"},{"en":"·","sm":"ua"},{"en":"·","sm":"i"},{"en":"·","sm":"ai"},{"en":"·","sm":"se"},{"en":"that there is cause","sm":"pogai"},{"en":"·","sm":"matou"},{"en":"·","sm":"te"},{"en":"·","sm":"salamo"},{"en":"for us to repent?","sm":"ai?"},{"en":"·","sm":"E"},{"en":"·","sm":"faapefea"},{"en":"·","sm":"ona"},{"en":"·","sm":"e"},{"en":"How knowest thou","sm":"iloa"},{"en":"·","sm":"e"},{"en":"·","sm":"le"},{"en":"·","sm":"o"},{"en":"·","sm":"i"},{"en":"that we are not","sm":"matou"},{"en":"·","sm":"o"},{"en":"·","sm":"ni"},{"en":"·","sm":"tagata"},{"en":"a righteous people?","sm":"amiotonu?"},{"en":"Behold,","sm":"Faauta,"},{"en":"·","sm":"ua"},{"en":